member.remarks:
This method dynamically renders sections of the filter UI based on the specified
flags. Each section corresponds to a specific filtering criterion, such as pawn types, health states, skills, or traits. If a section is enabled but its corresponding input ID (e.g.,
) is not provided, that section will be skipped. If the filter settings are modified during the UI interaction, the optional will be invoked to notify the caller of the change.
